flowchart LR
  A[Raw observations and metadata] --> B[Provenance and quality checks]
  B --> C[Instrument-aware harmonization]
  C --> D[Feature extraction: elevation, slope, roughness]
  D --> E[Spatial cells, overlaps and neighborhood edges]
  E --> F[Inferential-node graph]
  F --> G[Support / contradiction / dependency analysis]
  G --> H[Similarity and evidence coverage]
  H --> I[Candidate confidence classes]
  I --> J[Scientific decision trace]
  G --> K[Neutral node T=0.5 when unresolved]
  K --> F
  L[New observations] --> M[Incremental update]
  M --> F
